neuralmie-jax
=============

A JAX implementation of the NeuralMie aerosol-optics emulator.

This product includes software developed at Pacific Northwest National
Laboratory. The emulator networks, their pretrained weights, and the TAMie
Mie-scattering and bulk-optics reference algorithms are derived from:

    pnnl/NEURALMIE @ 0b5b1d8
